     3269     else do:
     3270       find first in-vatp_doc-attroprl no-lock
     3271         where in-vatp_doc-attroprl.doc-code  = out-vatp_partsprl.out-code
     3272           and in-vatp_doc-attroprl.attr-code = 'envd':U
     3273         no-error .
     3274       if not available in-vatp_doc-attroprl then do:
