     7280       End.
     7281     End.
     7282     if c-f-gds-name <>  ?  then do :
     7283       c-f-gds-name:screen-value = string(obj-list.obj-name) .
     7284       IF ( line-counter( OutStream )  modulo page-size( OutStream ) = 0 ) AND
     7285           ( line-counter( OutStream ) >= page-size( OutStream ) )          then DO:
