     7287       End.
     7288     End.
     7289     if c-f-qnty <>  ?  then do :
     7290       c-f-qnty:screen-value = string(accum TOTAL f-qnty) .
     7291       IF ( line-counter( OutStream )  modulo page-size( OutStream ) = 0 ) AND
     7292           ( line-counter( OutStream ) >= page-size( OutStream ) )          then DO:
     7293           display STREAM OutStream    with frame top-frame .
